                                                "sense_id": "4a8170f1-31d5-30b0-b1b0-ed96615f566e",
                                                "text": "[T]he inmates of the coach, by numerous hard, painful joltings, and ponderous, dragging trundlings, are suddenly made sensible of some great change in the character of the road."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "28625b7d-1cca-31af-8c3d-4413afca9850",
